{"type":"plan.created","runId":"01m5zghgzkjrfpjsz87n43xynq","ts":1793132704396,"payload":{"plan":{"id":"01m5zgkcmaryp5dr010zqn3tzx","goalId":"01m5zghgzk0jgmgt9zej4v22bk","summary":"Six disjoint lanes split the work into one shared date-library fix, four self-contained feature folders, and one shortcuts/help lane that consumes the search selector; only due-date badges and shortcuts wait on their upstream lane.","tasks":[{"key":"dates-fix","title":"Fix overdue and due-date sorting","goal":"In src/lib/dates.ts correct the overdue calculation so a todo due today is not overdue and only dates before the start of today are overdue; correct the due-date sorting comparator so valid due dates sort ascending and missing or invalid due dates sort last, with stable ordering for equal dates. Add regression coverage in src/lib/dates.test.ts that fails on the current implementation and passes after the fix. Do not change unrelated date formatting or refactor unrelated helpers.","deliverables":["Updated overdue predicate in src/lib/dates.ts","Updated due-date comparator/sort helper in src/lib/dates.ts","Regression tests in src/lib/dates.test.ts for overdue calculation and due-date sorting"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit src/features/**, src/ui/**, src/store/**, src/main.ts, or package.json","Do not change date formatting output unrelated to overdue calculation or sorting"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New regression tests assert that yesterday is overdue, today is not overdue, and tomorrow is not overdue","New sorting tests assert ascending valid due dates with missing due dates last","The new regression tests fail against the pre-fix implementation and pass after the fix"],"dependsOn":[],"lane":{"owns":["src/lib/dates.ts","src/lib/dates.test.ts"],"reads":["package.json","src/lib/ids.ts","src/store/todos.ts"]},"estimateMin":20},{"key":"theme","title":"Dark mode with persistent toggle","goal":"Implement the dark-mode theme feature entirely under src/features/theme/. Register a toolbar toggle through the existing feature/slot contract, apply dark mode by setting a stable data-theme attribute on document.documentElement, persist and restore the user preference using the existing storage/persistence approach, and import a feature-local theme.css with dark overrides. Do not edit global styles or the shared renderer.","deliverables":["src/features/theme/index.ts registering the theme feature and toolbar toggle","src/features/theme/theme.css with dark-theme overrides","src/features/theme/theme.test.ts covering toggle, document attribute, and preference persistence"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit src/ui/styles.css, src/ui/render.ts, src/features/index.ts, src/main.ts, or package.json","Do not edit other feature folders"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New test toggles dark mode on and asserts document.documentElement.dataset.theme becomes dark","New test asserts the stored preference is restored on a fresh mount and the toggle reflects the current theme","Toggling off removes the dark-theme attribute and restores the light theme"],"dependsOn":[],"lane":{"owns":["src/features/theme/**"],"reads":["src/features/README.md","src/features/registry.ts","src/features/index.ts","src/ui/slots.ts","src/ui/styles.css","src/store/persist.ts","src/testing/dom.ts"]},"estimateMin":25},{"key":"live-search","title":"Live search filtering","goal":"Implement live search entirely under src/features/search/. Register a toolbar search input and a filter through the existing feature/filter registry, update the active filter on every input event, and filter todos by case-insensitive title and tag matches. Expose the search input with a stable data-search-input attribute for keyboard shortcuts. Include feature-local styling and tests.","deliverables":["src/features/search/index.ts registering the search filter and toolbar input","src/features/search/search.css with search input styles","src/features/search/search.test.ts covering live filtering and clearing the query"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit src/ui/filters.ts, src/ui/render.ts, src/ui/styles.css, src/features/index.ts, src/main.ts, or package.json","Do not edit other feature folders"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New test types a query and asserts only matching titles or tags remain visible","New test clears the query and asserts all todos return","The search input has a stable data-search-input attribute"],"dependsOn":[],"lane":{"owns":["src/features/search/**"],"reads":["src/features/README.md","src/features/registry.ts","src/features/index.ts","src/ui/filters.ts","src/ui/slots.ts","src/ui/render.ts","src/store/todos.ts","src/testing/dom.ts"]},"estimateMin":20},{"key":"csv-export","title":"CSV export action","goal":"Implement CSV export entirely under src/features/export/. Register a toolbar Export CSV button through the existing feature/slot contract. On click, serialize the currently visible todos from the store/filter pipeline with a header row and RFC 4180-style escaping for commas, quotes, and newlines, then trigger a client-side download using Blob and URL.createObjectURL. Do not use network access or new dependencies.","deliverables":["src/features/export/index.ts registering the export button and CSV download behavior","src/features/export/export.test.ts covering CSV content, escaping, and download invocation"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit package.json, src/ui/**, src/store/**, src/features/index.ts, src/main.ts, or other feature folders","Do not add network calls or external CSV libraries"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New test asserts the exported CSV contains the expected header and escaped values for commas, quotes, and newlines","New test asserts URL.createObjectURL is called and the download is triggered without network access"],"dependsOn":[],"lane":{"owns":["src/features/export/**"],"reads":["src/features/README.md","src/features/registry.ts","src/features/index.ts","src/ui/slots.ts","src/ui/filters.ts","src/lib/commands.ts","src/store/todos.ts","src/testing/dom.ts"]},"estimateMin":20},{"key":"due-date-badges","title":"Due-date badges","goal":"Implement due-date badges entirely under src/features/due-dates/. Use the corrected helpers from src/lib/dates.ts to render a badge for todos with due dates: overdue dates show Overdue, today shows Due today, near-future dates show a concise upcoming label, and todos without due dates show no badge. Register the UI through the existing feature/slot contract and keep styles in the feature folder. Tests must use a deterministic clock or injected date so labels are stable.","deliverables":["src/features/due-dates/index.ts registering due-date badge behavior","src/features/due-dates/due-dates.css with badge styles","src/features/due-dates/due-dates.test.ts covering overdue, due-today, future, and no-due-date cases"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit src/lib/dates.ts, src/ui/**, src/features/index.ts, src/main.ts, package.json, or other feature folders","Do not duplicate or change the date overdue or sorting logic outside src/lib/dates.ts"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New test asserts yesterday's due date renders Overdue and today's renders Due today","New test asserts a future due date renders an upcoming badge and a todo without a due date renders no badge"],"dependsOn":["dates-fix"],"lane":{"owns":["src/features/due-dates/**"],"reads":["src/lib/dates.ts","src/features/README.md","src/features/registry.ts","src/features/index.ts","src/ui/slots.ts","src/ui/render.ts","src/store/todos.ts","src/testing/dom.ts"]},"estimateMin":18},{"key":"shortcuts-help","title":"Keyboard shortcuts and help overlay","goal":"Implement keyboard shortcuts and the help overlay across src/features/shortcuts/** and src/features/help/**. The help feature provides an accessible dialog listing shortcuts. The shortcuts feature installs a global keydown handler that ignores events from editable fields, maps n to the existing new-todo action/control, / to focusing the input marked data-search-input from the search feature, and ? to toggling the help dialog. Integrate only through existing command/slot/feature contracts and do not edit the search feature files.","deliverables":["src/features/help/index.ts and help.css with a togglable accessible shortcuts dialog","src/features/shortcuts/index.ts with global keydown handling for n, /, and ?","src/features/shortcuts/shortcuts.test.ts verifying key handling and help toggling"],"outOfScope":["Do not edit src/ui/**, src/features/index.ts, src/main.ts, src/features/search/**, package.json, or other feature folders","Do not implement shortcut handling that fires while the user is typing in inputs or textareas"],"definitionOfDone":["bun run test passes","bun run typecheck passes","New test dispatches / and asserts the data-search-input element receives focus","New test dispatches ? and asserts the help dialog opens and closes","New test dispatches n and asserts the existing new-todo action/control is triggered","New test asserts shortcuts are ignored when focus is inside an input"],"dependsOn":["live-search"],"lane":{"owns":["src/features/shortcuts/**","src/features/help/**"],"reads":["src/features/README.md","src/features/registry.ts","src/features/index.ts","src/features/search/**","src/ui/dom.ts","src/ui/slots.ts","src/lib/commands.ts","src/store/todos.ts","src/testing/dom.ts"]},"estimateMin":22}],"lockedDecisions":["Use TypeScript with Vite and Bun; do not add runtime dependencies or network calls.","Run tests with bun run test and typecheck with bun run typecheck.","Each feature lives under src/features/<name>/ with an index.ts built through the existing defineFeature/feature registry contract and its own tests and CSS.","Global UI files such as src/ui/render.ts, src/ui/styles.css, src/features/index.ts, and src/main.ts are shared and must not be edited by feature lanes.","Persist user preferences with the existing localStorage/persist helpers; do not change storage schema unless explicitly required by the feature.","Date calculations must go through src/lib/dates.ts; only the dates-fix lane may edit that file.","Use bun:test and existing DOM helpers such as src/testing/dom.ts for feature tests."],"model":{"provider":"opencode","model":"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash"},"createdAt":1793132704394},"issues":[]}}
